msgid "Delivers a ranged attack with a potency of 50.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Heavy</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +20%<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Removes <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Sprint</ui-edge-color></ui-color> effect<br><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Enhanced Weapon Throw:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Shortens recast time to 60 seconds.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Enhanced Weapon Throw II:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Extends duration to 8 seconds.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Enhanced Weapon Throw III:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Increases effect potency to 40%."
