msgid "Reveal the location of nearby enemies under the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Hide</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Enhanced Detect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Shortens recast time to 150 seconds."
