msgid "Locates enemies in a 50-yalm radius in front of you and displays them on allied maps.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s<br><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Enhanced Malmsight:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Shortens recast time to 90s."
